1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Choose Keyboard shortcut as the action. Record while its field is focused; this sample uses ⌘C.

2
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:17,417
Press Record shortcut, focus this field, then press the key combination. It stops recording after one shortcut.

3
00:00:17,417 --> 00:00:24,417
Save the shortcut. Normal actions outside the mouse capture box keep working while you edit a mapping.

4
00:00:24,417 --> 00:00:33,417
To delete, select the button AND its press type, then Remove action. Click, double click and hold are separate.

5
00:00:33,417 --> 00:00:40,417
The single-click action is removed. Undo restores it; other gestures on this button remain saved.

6
00:00:40,417 --> 00:00:47,542
Help → Troubleshooting checks permissions. Technical details are collapsed; expand them only when needed.

7
00:00:47,542 --> 00:00:54,833
Need to stop quickly? Press Control + Option + Command + Escape, or Pause from the menu bar.
